#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "You made it!"
msgstr "{crew|Ты успел|Ты успела|Вы успели}!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"You reached {place} before the pirates! The people of {place} chase the pirates away, and give you"
" {silver} silver."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Ты добрался|Ты добралась|Вы добрались} {place@to} раньше пиратов! Жители прогоняют пиратов и"
" дают {crew|тебе|тебе|вам} {silver} серебра."

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Caught!"
msgstr "Поймали!"

#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The pirates caught you! They laugh, kiss the prow of your boat, and sail away. Try again?"
msgstr ""
"Пираты {crew|тебя|тебя|вас} поймали! Они смеются, целуют нос {crew|твоей|твоей|вашей} лодки и "
"уплывают. Попробуем ещё раз?"

#. the title of a card (a button): a word or two, at most two short lines
#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Another chase!"
msgstr "Ещё погоня!"

#. the title of a card (a button): a word or two, at most two short lines
#: scenes/chase/chase.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "To the start"
msgstr "В начало"

#. the second line of a card (a button), under its title: a few words
