msgid "The Cracked Kiln"
msgstr "Треснувшая печь"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/062_the_cracked_kiln/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My kiln cracked in the frost! To build a new one I need six baskets of clay from Ekvik and three "
"sacks of charcoal from Grim to fire it."
msgstr ""
"Моя печь треснула от мороза! Чтобы построить новую, мне нужно шесть корзин глины из Эквика и три "
"мешка угля от Грима, чтобы её обжечь."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/062_the_cracked_kiln/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Clay again? Dagny must be building a castle!"
msgstr "Опять глина? Дагни, наверное, строит замок!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/062_the_cracked_kiln/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The new kiln glows! My first pots from it are for you."
msgstr "Новая печь светится! Первые горшки из неё — для {crew|тебя|тебя|вас}."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/062_the_cracked_kiln/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A potter's kiln is a small oven of clay, heated so hot that the pots glow."
msgstr ""
"Печь гончара — маленькая глиняная печка, которую так сильно разогревают, что горшки светятся."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for Ålberga"
msgstr "Сено для Ольберги"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So many lambs this spring! The ewes eat and eat, and my hay is gone. Bring me eight crates of hay "
"within two days."
msgstr ""
"Этой весной столько ягнят! Овцы всё едят и едят, и моё сено кончилось. "
"{crew|Привези|Привези|Привезите} мне восемь ящиков сена за два дня."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eight crates! The ewes munch, and the lambs jump around. Take a fleece of the softest wool."
msgstr ""
"Восемь ящиков! Овцы жуют, а ягнята прыгают вокруг. {crew|Возьми|Возьми|Возьмите} руно самой мягкой"
" шерсти."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/063_hay_for_alberga/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A sheep eats about two kilograms of hay a day."
msgstr "Овца съедает около двух килограммов сена в день."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/064_the_ferrymans_last_trip/mission.json
#, fuzzy
