#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/078_the_sleepy_hens/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our hens sit sleepy in the corner and lay no eggs. You are healers now: what do they need? Ask "
"Tova, and bring it."
msgstr ""
"Наши куры сидят сонные в углу и не несутся. {crew|Ты теперь целитель|Ты теперь целительница|Вы "
